  "description": "Re-write your legend through verse and blood, and bring respite to the tragic youth of Kalevala by besting mythical creatures, monsters, spirits - and even Life and Death themselves - in battle.\n\nPerform rituals, navigate treacherous lands, and learn from every misstep to become stronger.\n\nGet roused by:\n- Arming up with different weapons, artifacts and poems to craft the perfect build;\n- Learning the story of your characters, through besting challenging trials;\n- Testing your mettle against epic, old school boss encounters;\n- Bits and pieces of genuine finno-karelian legends;\n- The dynamic and intense sungeon synth OST!",
